579
00:17:45.556 --> 00:17:46.516
comandos.

580
00:17:46.516 --> 00:17:48.516
Aqui os exemplos de terminal usam Bash

581
00:17:48.516 --> 00:17:50.716
no Linux ou macOS;

582
00:17:51.296 --> 00:17:52.456
no Windows,

583
00:17:52.456 --> 00:17:55.236
use um ambiente Bash via WSL ou

584
00:17:55.236 --> 00:17:57.836
siga o instalador oficial para Windows.

