00:21:47.808 --> 00:21:49.208
Pontos para lembrar:

710
00:21:49.208 --> 00:21:50.548
Escopo local;

711
00:21:50.548 --> 00:21:51.568
README;

712
00:21:51.568 --> 00:21:52.423
AGENTS; arquivos de entrada.

713
00:21:52.423 --> 00:21:54.068
Vamos a

714
00:21:54.108 --> 00:21:55.088
um exemplo.

715
00:21:55.088 --> 00:21:56.458
O projeto possui

716
00:21:56.458 --> 00:21:58.208
README.md e

717
00:21:58.748 --> 00:21:59.948
